  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 35,
      "at": [
        -4,
        -16
      ],
      "text": "Adjustable and controlled sources. Run (F5) and drag V1 or I1 up and down (or turn the wheel over\nthem): V1 goes from 0 to 5 V and E1 doubles it (VM1 reads 2 x V1); I1 sends 0 to 20 mA through\nthe LED and F1 copies that current five times into AM1. Limits and gains are in Properties."
    }
  ]
